VERIFICATION
Verification is intended to assist the Chocolatey moderators and community
in verifying that this package's contents are trustworthy.

This package downloads the official release archive directly from the
project's GitHub Releases page at install time — it does not embed any
binary inside the .nupkg itself.

Download URL:
https://github.com/arnaudcharles/iso-auto-downloader/releases/download/v__VERSION__/iso-auto-downloader___VERSION___windows_amd64.zip

Expected SHA256 (the checksum64 value in chocolateyinstall.ps1):
__SHA256_AMD64__

To verify, download the URL above and compare:
  Get-FileHash iso-auto-downloader___VERSION___windows_amd64.zip -Algorithm SHA256

Note that the checksums.txt attached to the release covers the macOS
archive only: GoReleaser generates it in the macOS job, and the Windows
zips are built and attached by a later job in
.github/workflows/release.yml. The value above is computed by
.github/workflows/chocolatey.yml from the very asset attached to the
release, so it is never transcribed by hand.

Source code, GoReleaser config, and the GitHub Actions workflow that
produces this exact build are public in the project repository:
https://github.com/arnaudcharles/iso-auto-downloader
